cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "L2CO Optimizers: bare optimizers compatible with the L2CO library"
abstract: >-
  The optimizer registry, the UpdateClass container and the built-in optax
  and evosax-based optimizers (plus SHADE, TuRBO, an RBF trust region and
  per-evaluation-key L-BFGS) used by the L2CO meta-optimization stack, with
  the strategy-facing handshake and state-transfer layer and ready-made Hydra
  optimizer configs. Built on JAX/Equinox.
authors:
  - family-names: "van der Schelling"
    given-names: "Martin P."
    email: "m.p.vanderschelling@tudelft.nl"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/bessagroup/l2co-optimizers"
version: "0.1.0"
type: software
keywords:
  - optimization
  - optimizers
  - jax
  - equinox
  - evolution-strategies
